<title>INDIA: India call market inactive as banks close accounts.</title>
<headline>India call market inactive as banks close accounts.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian call money market was closed on Monday on account of half-yearly closure of bank accounts.</p>
<p>Call money was quoted 10.70-10.80 percent at the close of trade on the weekend after opening at 10.50-10.75 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
